# {{lb|en|Australia|slang|obsolete}} A punishment of 25 [[lash]]es (strokes of a [[whip]]) across a person′s back.<ref>'''1987''', [[w:Robert Hughes (critic)|Robert Hughes]], ''{{w|The Fatal Shore}}'', 1996, paperback, {{ISBN|1-86046-150-6}}, Chapter 12.</ref>
# A [[sample]] of [[perfume]] available in a shop for customers to try before they buy.
# A [[miniature]] [[pot]] of [[paint]] for testing and comparison purposes.
# {{lb|en|cycling}} A [[cyclist]] who focuses on success in [[time trial]]s.

